OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785847716
OL,3,CBoy, 14, drowns after going into the
OL,4,Cwater at Millwall Outer Dock
OL,6,FA 14-year-old boy has drowned in
OL,7,FMillwall Outer Dock in east London.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called on to
OL,10,Fthe scene near East Ferry Road on
OL,11,FMonday evening. His body was recovered
OL,12,Faround 22:30 and he died at the scene.
OL,14,FHis family has been told.
OL,16,FAssistant Commissioner Patrick
OL,17,FGoulbourne said: "Sadly, a teenager
OL,18,Fhas drowned following an incident in
OL,19,FBlackwall.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/4
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
