PN,37102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785847716
OL,3,CBoy, 14, drowns after going into the
OL,4,Cwater at Millwall Outer Dock
OL,6,F"Firefighters responded to reports of
OL,7,Fa teenager in the harbour and carried
OL,8,Fout a full search of the area. Sadly,
OL,9,Fdespite the best efforts of emergency
OL,10,Fresponders, the teenager was later
OL,11,Ffound dead.
OL,13,F"This is an incredibly sad incident,
OL,14,Fand the thoughts of everyone at London
OL,15,FFire Brigade are with the family and
OL,16,Floved ones at this difficult time."
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/4
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
