CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785847716
OL,3,CBoy, 14, drowns after going into the
OL,4,Cwater at Millwall Outer Dock
OL,6,FDetective Superintendent Oliver
OL,7,FRichter added: "Our thoughts remain
OL,8,Fwith the family and loved ones of this
OL,9,Fyoung boy at this incredibly difficult
OL,10,Ftime.
OL,12,F"As the warm weather continues, I
OL,13,Fwould urge everyone to remember that
OL,14,Fopen water can present serious
OL,15,Fdangers. Please only swim in
OL,16,Fdesignated areas and take the time to
OL,17,Fspeak with children and young people
OL,18,Fabout staying safe around water."
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/4
