OL,3,CBoy, 14, drowns after going into the
OL,4,Cwater at Millwall Outer Dock
OL,6,FThe boy's death is being treated as
OL,7,Funexpected but not suspicious and
OL,8,Fenquiries continue to prepare a report
OL,9,Ffor the coroner, police added.
